   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Talking about currency",
     "texto": [
      "**A schimba** is «to change». **Schimb** means «I change» when the person speaking is **eu**; **schimbați** can be used to address one person or several politely."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking about money",
     "texto": [
      "**A primi** means «to receive»: **primesc** («I receive») and **primiți** («receive», polite; «they receive»). In the practice sentences we do not set a real exchange rate."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
